DDUURRAATTIIOONN FFOORRMMAATT
     _d_u_r_a_t_i_o_n and _t_i_m_e may contain a decimal fraction.  The value defaults to
     seconds unless a unit suffix is given.

     The supported unit suffixes are:

           s       seconds
           m       minutes
           h       hours
           d       days

