     The ttiimmeeoouutt utility may return one of the following statuses:

     124     The time limit expired and the --pp flag was not set.
     126     The _c_o_m_m_a_n_d was found but could not be executed.
     127     The _c_o_m_m_a_n_d was not found.

     Otherwise, ttiimmeeoouutt returns the exit status of the _c_o_m_m_a_n_d.

